<h2 id="privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>This privacy policy (“Policy”) relates to the manner Pondi Express ("Gautam", “we”, “us”, “our”) in which we use, handle and process the data that you provide us in connection with using the products or services we offer. By using this website or by availing goods or services offered by us, the user agree to the terms and conditions of this Policy. Pondi Express is committed to protecting the privacy of users who access and use the website and related services ("Service"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you use our Service.</p>

<h3>Personal Information We Collect</h3>
<p>When the user register for or use the Service, we may collect certain personal information, including your name, address, phone number, email address and profile photograph. This information is collected to create and manage your account, maintain internal records, share information and updates, provide customer support, facilitate participation in fitness challenges, and improve your overall experience with the Service.</p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> Notwithstanding anything under this Policy as required under applicable Indian laws, we will not be storing any credit card, debit card or any other similar card data of yours. Please also note that all data or information collected from the user will be strictly in accordance with applicable laws and guidelines.</p>

<h3>Health and Fitness Data We Collect</h3>
<p>With the user's permission, the Service may collect and process health and fitness data, including step count, distance traveled, and workout or activity information. This data may be obtained through integrations with Google Fit or through information manually entered by users within the application.</p>

<h3>How We Use Health and Fitness Data</h3>
<p>Health and fitness data is collected solely to track progress, share feedback, enable challenge participation, marking completion of step-based activities or challenges, calculate challenge results, generate leaderboards, and display activity-related statistics within the app. Health and fitness information is used exclusively for these purposes and is not used for advertising, marketing, or promotional activities.</p>
<p>For certain running challenges and activity tracking features in our mobile application, we may access limited health and fitness-related information from user's device, specifically step count data, through platform-supported health services (such as Google Health Connect, Google Fit, or Apple Health, where applicable and authorized by the user).</p>
<p>Access to such health data is permission-based and occurs only after user provides consent through the user's device or application settings. User may revoke this permission at any time through your device settings; however, some activity tracking or challenge-related features may no longer function as intended.</p>

<h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
<p>We use the information collected to provide and improve our services, monitor challenge participation, maintain accurate rankings and leaderboards, verify challenge completion, ensure fair and effective operation of the platform, and provide customer support when required.</p>

<h3>Data Sharing and Third-Party Services</h3>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information or health data to third parties. However, we may share information with trusted service providers that assist us in operating the Service. For example, we use Firebase to support mobile application functionality, including authentication, secure data storage, analytics, and performance monitoring. These service providers are required to maintain the confidentiality and security of the information they process on our behalf.</p>

<h3>Data Security</h3>
<p>We take reasonable administrative, technical, and physical measures to safeguard your information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.</p>

<h3>Data Retention</h3>
<p>We retain the user's information only for as long as necessary to provide the Service, maintain challenge records, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. When information is no longer required, we take reasonable steps to securely delete or anonymize it.</p>

<h3>Account and Data Deletion Requests</h3>
<p>Users have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of their personal information and associated account data. If the user would like to request the deletion of their account or any personal information we hold, please contact us at <a href="mailto:coach@pondiexpress.com"><strong>coach@pondiexpress.com</strong></a>. We will review and process such requests within a reasonable timeframe, subject to applicable legal and operational requirements.</p>

<h3>Website cookies</h3>
<p>We use "cookies" to collect information and to better understand customer behaviour. The user can instruct their browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent. However, if the user do not accept cookies, they may not be able to avail our goods or services to the full extent. We do not control the use of cookies by third parties. The third party service providers have their own privacy policies addressing how they use such information.</p>

